uce\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n1. Create a new project.\n2. Import any PNG (even a 96x32 image).\n3. Create a TileSet.\n4. Change the Tile Size (for example 16x16 to 32x32).\n5. Wait about 2-3 seconds.\n6. Crash\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI cannot provide a minimal reproduction project because the crash also occurs in a brand new project immediately after creating a TileSet and changing the tile size.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122008/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122008/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}